   "lines": [
    "Went to a great afternoon",
    "reception at the Iselins;",
    "and to another at",
    "the Morans. I like",
    "these \"teas\"; I never",
    "stay more than two",
    "minutes with any",
    "girl and so don't",
    "get talked out."
   ],
